9
00:00:22,074 --> 00:00:25,354
(Stuart:)I also love how you
never use swear words.

10
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,780
(Sheldon:)You know, it turns out,

11
00:00:26,778 --> 00:00:30,918
(Sheldon:)you can hurt people
